Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.01,0:01:56.26,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,728)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)\t(5522,5564,\1a&HFF&)}Captain Kuro
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.01,0:01:56.26,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,728)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Captain Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call it murder, Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:02:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an accident that you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are those guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we listen a little\Ncloser, we can find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't simply kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is critical to our plan that Miss\NKaya perishes in an unfortunate accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't screw that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, on your signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the men and I stormed\Nthe village and managed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to accidentally kill the little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you get her inheritance\Nand we all get paid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance is astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not related, so how could\NI inherit anything from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll work very hard to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jango, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you kill her, you'll use your\Nhypnosis to make Kaya write her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it will say I leave my entire\Nfortune to my butler, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then and only then will I\Nhave undisputed control of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her enormous fortune and no\None will suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have spent three long years gaining\Nthe trust of everyone around me so that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be unsurprising for her to leave\Nthe entirety of her inheritance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years as a butler for this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure had us scared\Nback then, Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, you suddenly said\Nyou were giving up life as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In no time at all, you set\Nup someone to be your double.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you let the world see\NCaptain Kuro get executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only now do I understand that was\Njust the beginning of this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the man of a thousand plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I abandoned that name years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now wish to obtain my wealth without\Nattracting the attention of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pacifist you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murdering an entire family doesn't\Nexactly qualify as peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I haven't\Nmurdered an entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The father's death wasn't planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, it\Nmakes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's all the same to you,\Nhurry up and give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew is getting bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting in the waters\Nnear here for over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the men are growing\Nmore anxious by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it bad guy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What weren't you listening to any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys aren't just bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kaido is known to be the\Nmost devious skimming pirate around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though he's known for his smarts,\Nhe's legendary for his brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word had it that the Marines caught\Nand executed him three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Captain Kuro is alive and well,\Nposing as Klahadore the butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's had his diabolical sights set on\NKaya's fortune for the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First they'll attack the\Nvillage, then they'll kill Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is seriously bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get down! I'll see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stay away from that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot! They spotted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up and hide before they\Ndecide you need a long, slow death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, if it isn't Usopp,\Nthe mischievous town liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm spotted too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't hear a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we didn't hear anything about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And watch this ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the count of Jango, you\Nwill be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungle, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're still\Nfalling asleep on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to go and fall\Noff a cliff, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pity, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way he could have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he could say\Nwould sound like lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Django, tomorrow at daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The men are to attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rough up the villagers some.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tear up their homes a\Nlittle for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And above all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure Miss Kaya's\Ndeath looks accidental?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just accept it, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you can say or do to warn\Nthe villagers of this impending tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plans are flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the village I grew up with is\Nin danger, and Kaeya's going to be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:07:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Usopp, brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you've been a little down lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd tell you\Na story to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would do well to\Nmind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave, or I'll call\Nsomeone who will make you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy was\Nsupposed to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he still at the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looks really upset,\Nbut why still mad at the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,butler who knows no that\Nwasn't just a mad face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:09:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That look was different he was a\Ntragic face of sheer desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey why don't you guys show us\Nthe way to get down to that shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This smells like an adventure to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah something happened at Sure, I\Nthink this calls for the use of pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming! Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance!\NEverybody run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning they're\Ngonna attack the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're putting a stop to this here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know that you're\Nnothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would do you some good to follow\NClawdor's example of hard work and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he could say\Nwould sound like lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what\NClawdor is counting on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ignored me because he\Nknew no one would believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these to your liking, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Custom-made to your exact specifications
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite a trip to get\Nthem. They're just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for traveling\Nso far to get them for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a gift, aren't they? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as of tomorrow it will be exactly three
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years to the day since\NKlahadore arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always taken good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be delighted to\Nreceive such a lovely gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, pirates are going to\Nattack the village in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we believed every story\Nyou ever told us We would have
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,run screaming from the village\Nhundreds of times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please believe me, we don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying this time, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll murder you all You'll\Nbe lucky if we don't murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After three long years of absence, I\Nmade the call for my men and you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your loyalty will be richly rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:12:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend on being more than\Ngenerous when I divide the take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At dawn tomorrow, destroy the village to\Nyour heart's content. Oh, no! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are going to attack the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're going to kill Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what made you think\Nit'd be a good time for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a nap that's the thing i\Ndon't remember going to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleep or getting down\Nhere at all this proves
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that clawador is a bad guy\NUsopp saw right through
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him I bet he's on his way\Nto warn the villagers so
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll have time to run\Naway well that's perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those stupid pirates\Nwon't hurt anyone because
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the town will be abandoned\Nby the time they get
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better run away,\Ntoo, if we want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's pack our\Ntreasure and run like the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stock up before\Nthe meat shop guy leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not really\Nthe issue at hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried you wouldn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, run, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tricked the entire village!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clador's really a deadly pirate captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't one of my\Nstories, it's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard it with my own ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawdor is a pirate captain who weaseled\Nhis way into your family's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he could steal your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretended to be your\Nbutler for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he could kill you\Nand inherit your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His crew is going to\Nraid the village at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the process, you're\Ngoing to get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawdor's a very bad man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did treat you harshly earlier,\Nand I understand that you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But lying like this, it's not like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved them. Every one. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those lies you told me,\Nthey brought joy to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is just vengeful poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just trying to\Nget back at Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that? It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, is everything okay up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand her immediately, you villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please trust me, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of this village\Nbefore that butler gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise this will all make sense\Ntomorrow, but right now we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, please, please trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.18,0:16:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai alone, you maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let that lunatic get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke in and tried to\Nkidnap the lady of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't anyone believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're alive again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I had a pretty good nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sleeping the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, we heard all about those\Npirates and their evil plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better hurry and warn the people in\Nthe village so they have time to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warn the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know you're nothing but a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously I'm lying like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That butler made me so\Nmad with what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd get him back\Nand say that he was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put the Straw Hat guy up to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you've really\Ndisappointed me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though that butler guy is a jerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better\Nthan lying to hurt someone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I admired you for being\Nsuch a kind-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think we respected\Nyou this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's supper time anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how come you lied to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because all I do is lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way anybody was\Ngonna believe what I had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because what you were telling\Nthem was the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are coming, and they're\Ngoing to level this whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll think I'm lying\Nif I try to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the village thinks that tomorrow's\Njust going to be another normal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think I'm lying, and\Nthat's all they need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop those pirates\Nat the beach tomorrow myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault\Nfor being such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore if they drive me\Naway with brooms or shoot me in the arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I love everyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a hell of a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sending your cronies away\Nand going into battle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have dibs on all the\Npirate treasure, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want a little help or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, you're gonna help\Nme fight all these pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you said there's a whole\Nbunch of bad guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you look scared out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information,\NI have nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly okay with tons of bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you're looking at\Nthe legendary Captain Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brave warrior of the high seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Captain Curl's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need pity if you\Nguys are sticking around cuz
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you pity me just leave I\Ndon't need you laughing at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not laughing at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're helping because you are honorable
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think we risk\Nour lives out of pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the world ever changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.86,0:21:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

